  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-08T10:30:50.761Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I am not sure if VRChat is using the benefits of Texture Streaming or not. But there is clearly a mistake in the SDK, where the quality settings are modified by the SDK to NOT use Texture Streaming, but also complaining that Streaming Mipmaps have to be enabled. \nI think this is just a mistake and that VRChat should use the benefits of Texture Streaming and fix that parameter in Quality Settings.",
